# Vercel CLI uses this file INSTEAD of .gitignore to decide what to upload.
#
# Deliberately absent from this list: public/actress-cache/
# That crawled snapshot is the app's data. .gitignore excludes it so the 97
# profiles and images never enter the public GitHub repo, but the deployment
# needs them or the client gets 404 on status.json/current.json and renders
# the "Chưa thể tải dữ liệu cục bộ" error. Refresh it locally with
# `pnpm data:refresh`, then redeploy to publish the new snapshot.

.git
node_modules/
.next/
out/
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo
.env*
.DS_Store
.cache/
.vercel

# Not served by the app: promo video is README-only, tests never run on Vercel.
assets/
tests/
